      <p begin="00:08.840" end="00:12.140" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:08.840" end="00:09.080">That's</span> <span begin="00:09.080" end="00:09.160">the</span> <span begin="00:09.160" end="00:09.220">s</span><span begin="00:09.220" end="00:09.430">ta</span><span begin="00:09.430" end="00:09.570">te of</span> <span begin="00:09.570" end="00:09.890">my,</span> <span begin="00:09.890" end="00:09.950">s</span><span begin="00:09.950" end="00:10.170">tate</span> <span begin="00:10.170" end="00:10.340">of</span> <span begin="00:10.340" end="00:10.550">my,</span> <span begin="00:10.640" end="00:10.710">s</span><span begin="00:10.710" end="00:10.930">ta</span><span begin="00:10.930" end="00:11.080">te of</span> <span begin="00:11.080" end="00:11.470">my</span> <span begin="00:11.470" end="00:12.080">hea</span><span begin="00:12.080" end="00:12.140">d</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这便是我的 我的 我的心境</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">這便是我的 我的 我的心境</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">これが俺の 俺の 俺の心の有り様だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이게 바로 내 머릿속 내 상태 내 상태 내 상태야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Voilà l’état de mon esprit de mon esprit de mon esprit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Así está mi así está mi así está mi cabeza</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">So sieht es aus in meinem Kopf in meinem Kopf in meinem Kopf</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Esse é o estado da minha cabeça da minha cabeça da minha cabeça</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Вот что творится у меня в голове в голове в голове</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Questo è lo stato della mia testa della mia testa della mia testa</span></p>
      <p begin="00:14.840" end="00:17.840" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:14.840" end="00:15.080">That's</span> <span begin="00:15.080" end="00:15.160">the</span> <span begin="00:15.160" end="00:15.220">s</span><span begin="00:15.220" end="00:15.430">ta</span><span begin="00:15.430" end="00:15.570">te of</span> <span begin="00:15.570" end="00:15.810">my,</span> <span begin="00:15.890" end="00:15.950">s</span><span begin="00:15.950" end="00:16.170">tate</span> <span begin="00:16.170" end="00:16.330">of</span> <span begin="00:16.330" end="00:16.560">my,</span> <span begin="00:16.640" end="00:16.710">s</span><span begin="00:16.710" end="00:16.930">ta</span><span begin="00:16.930" end="00:17.080">te of</span> <span begin="00:17.080" end="00:17.470">my</span> <span begin="00:17.470" end="00:17.840">head</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这便是我的 我的 我的心境</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">這便是我的 我的 我的心境</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">これが俺の 俺の 俺の心の有り様だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이게 바로 내 머릿속 내 상태 내 상태 내 상태야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Voilà l’état de mon esprit de mon esprit de mon esprit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Así está mi así está mi así está mi cabeza</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">So sieht es aus in meinem Kopf in meinem Kopf in meinem Kopf</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Esse é o estado da minha cabeça da minha cabeça da minha cabeça</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Вот что творится у меня в голове в голове в голове</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Questo è lo stato della mia testa della mia testa della mia testa</span></p>
      <p begin="00:17.710" end="00:23.060" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:17.710" end="00:17.780">I</span><span begin="00:17.780" end="00:17.860">t's</span> <span begin="00:17.860" end="00:18.070">been</span> <span begin="00:18.070" end="00:18.190">a</span> <span begin="00:18.600" end="00:19.370">long</span> <span begin="00:19.370" end="00:19.590">bum</span><span begin="00:19.590" end="00:19.730">py</span> <span begin="00:19.730" end="00:19.970">ride</span> <span begin="00:20.080" end="00:20.340">sit</span><span begin="00:20.340" end="00:20.460">ting</span> <span begin="00:20.460" end="00:20.720">ba</span><span begin="00:20.830" end="00:21.030">ck in</span> <span begin="00:21.030" end="00:21.160">the</span> <span begin="00:21.160" end="00:21.450">sa</span><span begin="00:21.450" end="00:21.540">d</span><span begin="00:21.540" end="00:23.060">dle</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一路颠沛许久 如今我再度跨上鞍背</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">一路顛沛許久 如今我再度跨上鞍背</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">長く荒れた道を越え 再び鞍へと身を預ける</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">긴 험로를 지나 다시 안장에 올라탔어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La route a été longue et chaotique mais me voilà de nouveau en selle</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ha sido un viaje largo y accidentado pero volvemos a la silla</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Es war ein langer holpriger Ritt doch jetzt sitz ich wieder fest im Sattel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Foi uma longa jornada cheia de solavancos de volta à sela</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Долгий и тяжёлый путь но я снова в седле</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">È stato un viaggio lungo e accidentato ma sono di nuovo in sella</span></p>
      <p begin="00:23.710" end="00:28.780" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:23.710" end="00:23.760">I</span><span begin="00:23.760" end="00:23.820">t's</span> <span begin="00:23.820" end="00:24.020">time</span> <span begin="00:24.100" end="00:24.220">to</span> <span begin="00:24.590" end="00:24.770">get</span> <span begin="00:24.950" end="00:25.470">dow</span><span begin="00:25.470" end="00:25.520">n,</span> <span begin="00:25.720" end="00:25.960">dir</span><span begin="00:25.960" end="00:26.110">ty</span> <span begin="00:26.110" end="00:26.230">u</span><span begin="00:26.310" end="00:26.460">p our</span> <span begin="00:26.460" end="00:26.800">knee</span><span begin="00:26.800" end="00:26.860">s</span> <span begin="00:26.860" end="00:27.040">in</span> <span begin="00:27.040" end="00:27.080">the</span> <span begin="00:27.190" end="00:27.430">ba</span><span begin="00:27.430" end="00:27.450">t</span><span begin="00:27.450" end="00:28.780">tle</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是时候亲赴战阵 任双膝染尽泥尘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">是時候親赴戰陣 任雙膝染盡泥塵</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">さあ戦場へ降り立て 膝を泥に染める時だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이젠 뛰어들 시간이야 전투 속에서 무릎까지 더럽혀</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Il est temps de descendre de nous salir les genoux dans la bataille</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Es hora de bajar al barro y ensuciarnos las rodillas en la batalla</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Es ist Zeit runterzugehen uns im Kampf die Knie schmutzig zu machen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Chegou a hora de descer e sujar os joelhos na batalha</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Пора спуститься в грязь и встать на колени в этой битве</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">È ora di scendere in campo e sporcarci le ginocchia nella battaglia</span></p>
      <p begin="00:29.710" end="00:35.330" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:29.710" end="00:29.830">Oh,</span> <span begin="00:29.830" end="00:30.080">co</span><span begin="00:30.080" end="00:30.280">me on,</span> <span begin="00:30.610" end="00:31.330">roun</span><span begin="00:31.330" end="00:31.470">d up</span> <span begin="00:31.560" end="00:31.630">the</span> <span begin="00:31.720" end="00:32.000">boy</span><span begin="00:32.000" end="00:32.090">s,</span> <span begin="00:32.090" end="00:32.320">gon</span><span begin="00:32.320" end="00:32.470">na</span> <span begin="00:32.470" end="00:32.590">make</span> <span begin="00:32.680" end="00:32.820">the</span> <span begin="00:32.820" end="00:33.080">wall</span><span begin="00:33.080" end="00:33.210">s</span> <span begin="00:33.210" end="00:33.460">rat</span><span begin="00:33.460" end="00:35.330">tle</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哦 来吧 召齐弟兄 让四壁都为之震颤</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">哦 來吧 召齊弟兄 讓四壁都為之震顫</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">さあ来い 仲間を呼び集めろ 壁さえ震わせてやる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">오 어서 녀석들을 전부 불러 모아 벽까지 뒤흔들자</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Oh allez rassemble les gars on va faire trembler les murs</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Oh vamos reúne a los muchachos haremos temblar las paredes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Oh komm schon trommelt die Jungs zusammen wir bringen die Wände zum Beben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ah vamos lá juntem os caras vamos fazer as paredes tremerem</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Эй давайте собирайте всех парней мы заставим стены дрожать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Oh forza radunate i ragazzi faremo tremare i muri</span></p>
      <p begin="00:35.850" end="00:37.270" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:35.850" end="00:36.080">Oh,</span> <span begin="00:36.080" end="00:36.260">our</span> <span begin="00:36.430" end="00:36.830">flag</span> <span begin="00:36.830" end="00:36.880">i</span><span begin="00:36.880" end="00:36.980">s</span> <span begin="00:36.980" end="00:37.200">tat</span><span begin="00:37.200" end="00:37.270">tered</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哦 我们的旌旗早已残破</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">哦 我們的旌旗早已殘破</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">ああ 俺たちの旗は千切れ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">오 우리의 깃발은 너덜너덜해졌고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Oh notre drapeau est en lambeaux</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Oh nuestra bandera está hecha jirones</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Oh unsere Fahne ist zerfetzt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ah nossa bandeira está em farrapos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Эй наш флаг изодран</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Oh la nostra bandiera è a brandelli</span></p>
      <p begin="00:37.350" end="00:38.740" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:37.350" end="00:37.580">An</span><span begin="00:37.580" end="00:37.760">d our</span> <span begin="00:37.950" end="00:38.250">bone</span><span begin="00:38.250" end="00:38.300">s</span> <span begin="00:38.300" end="00:38.400">are</span> <span begin="00:38.400" end="00:38.670">shat</span><span begin="00:38.670" end="00:38.740">tered</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的筋骨也已碎裂</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們的筋骨也已碎裂</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">骨さえ砕け散っている</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리의 뼈는 산산이 부서졌지만</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et nos os sont brisés</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y nuestros huesos están destrozados</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und unsere Knochen sind zerschmettert</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E nossos ossos estão quebrados</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И наши кости разбиты</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E le nostre ossa sono spezzate</span></p>
      <p begin="00:38.850" end="00:40.250" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:38.850" end="00:39.060">Bu</span><span begin="00:39.060" end="00:39.160">t it</span> <span begin="00:39.450" end="00:39.800">doe</span><span begin="00:39.800" end="00:39.970">sn't</span> <span begin="00:39.970" end="00:40.190">mat</span><span begin="00:40.190" end="00:40.250">ter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可那又何妨</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">可那又何妨</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">それが何だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그래도 상관없어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mais ça n’a aucune importance</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Pero no importa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Doch das spielt keine Rolle</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mas isso não importa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Но это неважно</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ma non importa</span></p>
      <p begin="00:40.320" end="00:42.170" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:40.320" end="00:40.500">'Cau</span><span begin="00:40.500" end="00:40.590">se</span> <span begin="00:40.590" end="00:40.710">we're</span> <span begin="00:40.710" end="00:41.070">mo</span><span begin="00:41.070" end="00:41.350">ving</span> <span begin="00:41.480" end="00:41.990">for</span><span begin="00:41.990" end="00:42.170">ward</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我们仍在向前</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">因為我們仍在向前</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">それでも俺たちは前へ進む</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우린 계속 앞으로 나아가니까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Parce qu’on continue d’avancer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Porque seguimos avanzando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Denn wir gehen weiter voran</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Porque seguimos em frente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Потому что мы идём вперёд</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perché continuiamo ad avanzare</span></p>
      <p begin="00:42.580" end="00:45.130" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:42.580" end="00:42.840">Roun</span><span begin="00:42.840" end="00:42.970">d 'e</span><span begin="00:42.970" end="00:43.120">m up,</span> <span begin="00:43.330" end="00:43.580">roun</span><span begin="00:43.580" end="00:43.710">d 'e</span><span begin="00:43.710" end="00:43.860">m up,</span> <span begin="00:44.100" end="00:44.290">le</span><span begin="00:44.290" end="00:44.450">t's</span> <span begin="00:44.450" end="00:45.130">go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都召集起来 都召集起来 出发</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">都召集起來 都召集起來 出發</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">集え 集え さあ行くぞ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">전부 불러 모아 전부 모아 가자</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Rassemble-les rassemble-les allons-y</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Reúnelos reúnelos vamos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Trommelt sie zusammen trommelt sie zusammen los geht's</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Juntem todo mundo juntem todo mundo vamos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Собирай их собирай их вперёд</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Radunateli radunateli andiamo</span></p>
      <p begin="00:45.540" end="00:47.450" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:45.540" end="00:45.800">Roun</span><span begin="00:45.800" end="00:45.920">d 'e</span><span begin="00:45.920" end="00:46.090">m up,</span> <span begin="00:46.280" end="00:46.500">le</span><span begin="00:46.500" end="00:46.670">t's</span> <span begin="00:46.670" end="00:47.450">go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">召集起来 出发</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">召集起來 出發</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">集え さあ行くぞ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">전부 불러 모아 가자</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Rassemble-les allons-y</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Reúnelos vamos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Trommelt sie zusammen los geht's</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Juntem todo mundo vamos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Собирай их вперёд</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Radunateli andiamo</span></p>
      <p begin="00:48.570" end="00:51.200" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:48.570" end="00:49.090">Oh,</span> <span begin="00:49.170" end="00:49.360">my</span> <span begin="00:49.360" end="00:49.490">eye</span><span begin="00:49.490" end="00:49.560">s</span> <span begin="00:49.560" end="00:49.680">are</span> <span begin="00:49.680" end="00:50.070">see</span><span begin="00:50.070" end="00:50.430">ing</span> <span begin="00:50.430" end="00:51.120">re</span><span begin="00:51.120" end="00:51.200">d</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哦 我眼中只余一片血红</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">哦 我眼中只餘一片血紅</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">ああ この目は怒りに赤く染まる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">오 내 눈앞이 온통 붉게 보여</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Oh je vois rouge</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Oh lo veo todo rojo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Oh vor meinen Augen ist alles rot</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ah meus olhos só enxergam vermelho</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Эй перед глазами всё красное</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Oh vedo tutto rosso</span></p>
      <p begin="00:51.550" end="00:54.120" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:51.550" end="00:51.790">Dou</span><span begin="00:51.790" end="00:51.920">ble</span> <span begin="00:51.920" end="00:52.120">vi</span><span begin="00:52.120" end="00:52.300">sion</span> <span begin="00:52.300" end="00:52.540">from</span> <span begin="00:52.540" end="00:52.590">the</span> <span begin="00:52.670" end="00:52.940">blood</span> <span begin="00:53.030" end="00:53.260">we</span><span begin="00:53.260" end="00:53.320">'ve</span> <span begin="00:53.400" end="00:54.120">shed</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们流下的鲜血 令眼前重影交叠</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們流下的鮮血 令眼前重影交疊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">流した血に霞み 景色さえ二重に揺れる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리가 흘린 피 때문에 시야가 두 겹으로 겹쳐</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je vois double à cause de tout le sang qu’on a versé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Veo doble por la sangre que hemos derramado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich sehe doppelt von all dem Blut das wir vergossen haben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Visão dupla por todo o sangue que derramamos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В глазах двоится от крови что мы пролили</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Vedo doppio per tutto il sangue che abbiamo versato</span></p>
      <p begin="00:54.430" end="00:56.770" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="00:54.430" end="00:54.550">The</span> <span begin="00:54.550" end="00:55.160">on</span><span begin="00:55.160" end="00:55.320">ly</span> <span begin="00:55.320" end="00:55.530">way</span> <span begin="00:55.530" end="00:55.690">I'm</span> <span begin="00:55.690" end="00:55.910">lea</span><span begin="00:55.910" end="00:56.040">ving</span> <span begin="00:56.040" end="00:56.300">i</span><span begin="00:56.300" end="00:56.430">s</span> <span begin="00:56.430" end="00:56.770">dead</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若要我退场 唯有以死相逼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">若要我退場 唯有以死相逼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">俺がここを去るのは 屍となる時だけだ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내가 여기서 떠나는 건 죽었을 때뿐이야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je ne partirai d’ici que mort</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Solo me iré de aquí muerto</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich gehe hier nur tot von dannen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Só vou sair daqui morto</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я уйду отсюда только мёртвым</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Me ne andrò soltanto da morto</span></p>
      <p begin="00:56.820" end="01:00.120" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="00:56.820" end="00:56.970">Tha</span><span begin="00:56.970" end="00:57.070">t's</span> <span begin="00:57.070" end="00:57.130">the</span> <span begin="00:57.130" end="00:57.210">s</span><span begin="00:57.210" end="00:57.420">ta</span><span begin="00:57.420" end="00:57.560">te of</span> <span begin="00:57.560" end="00:57.800">my,</span> <span begin="00:57.800" end="00:57.930">s</span><span begin="00:57.930" end="00:58.170">ta</span><span begin="00:58.170" end="00:58.300">te of</span> <span begin="00:58.300" end="00:58.540">my,</span> <span begin="00:58.540" end="00:58.700">s</span><span begin="00:58.700" end="00:58.920">ta</span><span begin="00:58.920" end="00:59.070">te of</span> <span begin="00:59.070" end="00:59.450">my</span> <span begin="00:59.450" end="01:00.040">hea</span><span begin="01:00.040" end="01:00.120">d</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这便是我的 我的 我的心境</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">這便是我的 我的 我的心境</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">これが俺の 俺の 俺の心の有り様だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이게 바로 내 머릿속 내 상태 내 상태 내 상태야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Voilà l’état de mon esprit de mon esprit de mon esprit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Así está mi así está mi así está mi cabeza</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">So sieht es aus in meinem Kopf in meinem Kopf in meinem Kopf</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Esse é o estado da minha cabeça da minha cabeça da minha cabeça</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Вот что творится у меня в голове в голове в голове</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Questo è lo stato della mia testa della mia testa della mia testa</span></p>
      <p begin="01:00.580" end="01:01.720" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:00.580" end="01:00.800">They</span> <span begin="01:00.800" end="01:01.160">don't</span> <span begin="01:01.160" end="01:01.720">know</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们从不知道</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">他們從不知道</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">奴らは知らない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그들은 몰라</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ils ne savent pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ellos no saben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Sie wissen nicht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eles não sabem</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Они не знают</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Loro non sanno</span></p>
      <p begin="01:02.070" end="01:03.400" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="01:02.070" end="01:02.310">Where</span> <span begin="01:02.310" end="01:02.580">we've</span> <span begin="01:02.700" end="01:03.400">been</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们曾走过何等征途</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們曾走過何等征途</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">俺たちが何を越えてきたのか</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리가 어디를 거쳐 왔는지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Par où nous sommes passés</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Por dónde hemos pasado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wo wir gewesen sind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Por onde passamos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Через что мы прошли</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Dove siamo stati</span></p>
      <p begin="01:03.570" end="01:06.300" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="01:03.570" end="01:03.760">We</span> <span begin="01:03.760" end="01:04.000">got</span> <span begin="01:04.120" end="01:04.350">that</span> <span begin="01:04.480" end="01:04.720">con</span><span begin="01:04.840" end="01:05.130">crete</span> <span begin="01:05.130" end="01:05.240">s</span><span begin="01:05.240" end="01:05.500">treet</span> <span begin="01:05.500" end="01:05.630">s</span><span begin="01:05.630" end="01:06.300">kin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">街巷与水泥 早已磨成我们坚硬的皮囊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">街巷與水泥 早已磨成我們堅硬的皮囊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">この身には街路で刻まれた鋼の皮膚がある</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우린 콘크리트 거리에서 단련된 피부를 가졌어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">On a la peau dure forgée dans le béton des rues</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tenemos la piel curtida por calles de concreto</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wir haben eine Haut aus Beton und Asphalt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Temos a pele endurecida pelas ruas de concreto</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">У нас кожа закалённая бетонными улицами</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Abbiamo la pelle dura delle strade di cemento</span></p>
