      <p begin="01:17.830" end="01:24.100" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="01:17.830" end="01:18.000">We</span><span begin="01:18.000" end="01:18.050">'ve</span> <span begin="01:18.050" end="01:18.210">been</span> <span begin="01:18.560" end="01:18.840">sho</span><span begin="01:18.840" end="01:19.040">t up,</span> <span begin="01:19.370" end="01:19.550">bea</span><span begin="01:19.550" end="01:19.760">t up</span> <span begin="01:20.090" end="01:20.310">by</span> <span begin="01:20.310" end="01:20.370">the</span> <span begin="01:20.450" end="01:20.690">fal</span><span begin="01:20.690" end="01:20.840">ling</span> <span begin="01:20.840" end="01:21.030">of</span> <span begin="01:21.030" end="01:21.110">the</span> <span begin="01:21.210" end="01:21.430">ar</span><span begin="01:21.430" end="01:22.660">row</span><span begin="01:22.990" end="01:23.170">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们曾中弹 曾受重击 也曾被漫天落箭所伤</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們曾中彈 曾受重擊 也曾被漫天落箭所傷</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">撃ち抜かれ 打ちのめされ 降り注ぐ矢を浴び続けた</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우린 화살비에 꿰뚫리고 얻어맞으며 버텨 왔어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">On nous a criblés de coups frappés sous une pluie de flèches</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Nos han disparado y golpeado bajo una lluvia de flechas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wir wurden getroffen und niedergeschlagen vom Hagel der Pfeile</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Fomos alvejados espancados sob uma chuva de flechas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Нас расстреливали нас избивали под градом стрел</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ci hanno trafitti e massacrati sotto una pioggia di frecce</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="01:21.970" end="01:24.100"><span begin="01:21.970" end="01:22.650">(Arrow</span><span begin="01:22.650" end="01:22.720">s</span> <span begin="01:22.720" end="01:23.350">arrow</span><span begin="01:23.350" end="01:23.470">s</span> <span begin="01:23.470" end="01:24.100">arrows)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">箭矢 箭矢 箭矢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">箭矢 箭矢 箭矢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">矢が 矢が 矢が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">화살 화살 화살</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Des flèches des flèches des flèches</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Flechas flechas flechas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Pfeile Pfeile Pfeile</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Flechas flechas flechas flechas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Стрел стрел стрел</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Frecce frecce frecce</span></span></p>
      <p begin="01:23.830" end="01:28.700" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:23.830" end="01:24.060">Yeah,</span> <span begin="01:24.060" end="01:24.240">I'm</span> <span begin="01:24.600" end="01:24.800">ful</span><span begin="01:24.800" end="01:25.020">l of</span> <span begin="01:25.340" end="01:25.550">deep</span> <span begin="01:25.690" end="01:25.960">cu</span><span begin="01:25.960" end="01:26.080">ts</span> <span begin="01:26.080" end="01:26.300">right</span> <span begin="01:26.440" end="01:26.710">down</span> <span begin="01:26.820" end="01:27.050">to</span> <span begin="01:27.050" end="01:27.110">the</span> <span begin="01:27.210" end="01:27.450">mar</span><span begin="01:27.450" end="01:28.700">row</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没错 我满身皆是深至骨髓的伤痕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">沒錯 我滿身皆是深至骨髓的傷痕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">ああ 傷は深く 骨の髄まで抉られている</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그래 골수까지 파고든 깊은 상처투성이야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ouais je suis couvert de plaies profondes jusqu’à la moelle</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sí estoy lleno de cortes profundos que llegan hasta la médula</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ja ich bin voller tiefer Schnitte bis hinunter ins Mark</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">É estou coberto de cortes profundos até a medula</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Да я весь в глубоких ранах до самого костного мозга</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sì sono pieno di ferite profonde fino al midollo</span></p>
      <p begin="01:29.820" end="01:36.030" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:29.820" end="01:29.950">But</span> <span begin="01:30.050" end="01:30.220">there</span><span begin="01:30.220" end="01:30.310">'s</span> <span begin="01:30.450" end="01:30.940">no</span> <span begin="01:30.940" end="01:31.180">doubt</span> <span begin="01:31.180" end="01:31.310">we'll</span> <span begin="01:31.310" end="01:31.520">ge</span><span begin="01:31.520" end="01:31.930">t out</span> <span begin="01:32.080" end="01:32.310">from</span> <span begin="01:32.310" end="01:32.440">the</span> <span begin="01:32.440" end="01:32.670">bot</span><span begin="01:32.670" end="01:32.790">to</span><span begin="01:32.790" end="01:33.020">m of</span> <span begin="01:33.020" end="01:33.080">the</span> <span begin="01:33.160" end="01:33.400">bar</span><span begin="01:33.400" end="01:34.710">rel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我深知 我们终会自绝境之底爬出</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">但我深知 我們終會自絕境之底爬出</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">それでも迷いはない この奈落から必ず這い上がる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">하지만 의심할 필요 없어 우린 반드시 밑바닥에서 기어 올라갈 테니까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mais aucun doute on remontera du fond du gouffre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Pero no hay duda saldremos del fondo del pozo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Doch es besteht kein Zweifel wir kommen wieder vom tiefsten Grund hoch</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mas não há dúvida de que vamos sair do fundo do poço</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Но нет сомнений мы выберемся с самого дна</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ma non c'è dubbio risaliremo dal fondo del barile</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="01:34.670" end="01:36.030"><span begin="01:34.670" end="01:34.970">(Bar</span><span begin="01:34.970" end="01:36.030">rel)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绝境之底</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">絕境之底</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">この奈落から</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">밑바닥에서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Du gouffre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Del pozo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Vom Grund</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Do fundo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Со дна</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Del barile</span></span></p>
      <p begin="01:35.850" end="01:37.250" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="01:35.850" end="01:36.070">Oh,</span> <span begin="01:36.070" end="01:36.240">our</span> <span begin="01:36.430" end="01:36.810">flag</span> <span begin="01:36.810" end="01:36.870">i</span><span begin="01:36.870" end="01:36.970">s</span> <span begin="01:36.970" end="01:37.190">tat</span><span begin="01:37.190" end="01:37.250">tered</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哦 我们的旌旗早已残破</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">哦 我們的旌旗早已殘破</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">ああ 俺たちの旗は千切れ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">오 우리의 깃발은 너덜너덜해졌고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Oh notre drapeau est en lambeaux</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Oh nuestra bandera está hecha jirones</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Oh unsere Fahne ist zerfetzt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ah nossa bandeira está em farrapos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Эй наш флаг изодран</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Oh la nostra bandiera è a brandelli</span></p>
      <p begin="01:37.350" end="01:38.760" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="01:37.350" end="01:37.580">An</span><span begin="01:37.580" end="01:37.750">d our</span> <span begin="01:37.940" end="01:38.240">bone</span><span begin="01:38.240" end="01:38.280">s</span> <span begin="01:38.280" end="01:38.340">are</span> <span begin="01:38.420" end="01:38.660">shat</span><span begin="01:38.660" end="01:38.760">tered</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的筋骨也已碎裂</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們的筋骨也已碎裂</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">骨さえ砕け散っている</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리의 뼈는 산산이 부서졌지만</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et nos os sont brisés</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y nuestros huesos están destrozados</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und unsere Knochen sind zerschmettert</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E nossos ossos estão quebrados</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И наши кости разбиты</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E le nostre ossa sono spezzate</span></p>
      <p begin="01:38.830" end="01:40.240" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="01:38.830" end="01:39.050">Bu</span><span begin="01:39.050" end="01:39.170">t it</span> <span begin="01:39.440" end="01:39.790">doe</span><span begin="01:39.790" end="01:39.950">sn't</span> <span begin="01:39.950" end="01:40.190">mat</span><span begin="01:40.190" end="01:40.240">ter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可那又何妨</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">可那又何妨</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">それが何だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그래도 상관없어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mais ça n’a aucune importance</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Pero no importa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Doch das spielt keine Rolle</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mas isso não importa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Но это неважно</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ma non importa</span></p>
      <p begin="01:40.310" end="01:42.160" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="01:40.310" end="01:40.480">'Cau</span><span begin="01:40.480" end="01:40.580">se</span> <span begin="01:40.580" end="01:40.690">we're</span> <span begin="01:40.690" end="01:41.080">mo</span><span begin="01:41.080" end="01:41.330">ving</span> <span begin="01:41.480" end="01:41.970">for</span><span begin="01:41.970" end="01:42.160">ward</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我们仍在向前</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">因為我們仍在向前</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">それでも俺たちは前へ進む</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우린 계속 앞으로 나아가니까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Parce qu’on continue d’avancer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Porque seguimos avanzando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Denn wir gehen weiter voran</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Porque seguimos em frente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Потому что мы идём вперёд</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perché continuiamo ad avanzare</span></p>
      <p begin="01:42.570" end="01:45.130" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="01:42.570" end="01:42.830">Roun</span><span begin="01:42.830" end="01:42.950">d 'e</span><span begin="01:42.950" end="01:43.100">m up,</span> <span begin="01:43.340" end="01:43.580">roun</span><span begin="01:43.580" end="01:43.700">d 'e</span><span begin="01:43.700" end="01:43.840">m up,</span> <span begin="01:44.080" end="01:44.270">le</span><span begin="01:44.270" end="01:44.440">t's</span> <span begin="01:44.440" end="01:45.130">go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都召集起来 都召集起来 出发</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">都召集起來 都召集起來 出發</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">集え 集え さあ行くぞ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">전부 불러 모아 전부 모아 가자</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Rassemble-les rassemble-les allons-y</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Reúnelos reúnelos vamos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Trommelt sie zusammen trommelt sie zusammen los geht's</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Juntem todo mundo juntem todo mundo vamos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Собирай их собирай их вперёд</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Radunateli radunateli andiamo</span></p>
      <p begin="01:45.530" end="01:47.450" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="01:45.530" end="01:45.790">Roun</span><span begin="01:45.790" end="01:45.910">d 'e</span><span begin="01:45.910" end="01:46.090">m up,</span> <span begin="01:46.270" end="01:46.490">le</span><span begin="01:46.490" end="01:46.660">t's</span> <span begin="01:46.660" end="01:47.450">go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">召集起来 出发</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">召集起來 出發</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">集え さあ行くぞ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">전부 불러 모아 가자</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Rassemble-les allons-y</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Reúnelos vamos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Trommelt sie zusammen los geht's</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Juntem todo mundo vamos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Собирай их вперёд</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Radunateli andiamo</span></p>
      <p begin="01:48.570" end="01:51.190" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="01:48.570" end="01:49.170">Oh,</span> <span begin="01:49.170" end="01:49.350">my</span> <span begin="01:49.350" end="01:49.480">eye</span><span begin="01:49.480" end="01:49.550">s</span> <span begin="01:49.550" end="01:49.610">are</span> <span begin="01:49.690" end="01:50.060">see</span><span begin="01:50.060" end="01:50.430">ing</span> <span begin="01:50.430" end="01:51.130">re</span><span begin="01:51.130" end="01:51.190">d</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哦 我眼中只余一片血红</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">哦 我眼中只餘一片血紅</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">ああ この目は怒りに赤く染まる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">오 내 눈앞이 온통 붉게 보여</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Oh je vois rouge</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Oh lo veo todo rojo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Oh vor meinen Augen ist alles rot</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ah meus olhos só enxergam vermelho</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Эй перед глазами всё красное</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Oh vedo tutto rosso</span></p>
      <p begin="01:51.550" end="01:54.140" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="01:51.550" end="01:51.780">Dou</span><span begin="01:51.780" end="01:51.910">ble</span> <span begin="01:51.910" end="01:52.120">vi</span><span begin="01:52.120" end="01:52.300">sion</span> <span begin="01:52.300" end="01:52.530">from</span> <span begin="01:52.530" end="01:52.660">the</span> <span begin="01:52.660" end="01:52.940">blood</span> <span begin="01:53.030" end="01:53.260">we</span><span begin="01:53.260" end="01:53.310">'ve</span> <span begin="01:53.410" end="01:54.140">shed</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们流下的鲜血 令眼前重影交叠</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們流下的鮮血 令眼前重影交疊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">流した血に霞み 景色さえ二重に揺れる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리가 흘린 피 때문에 시야가 두 겹으로 겹쳐</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je vois double à cause de tout le sang qu’on a versé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Veo doble por la sangre que hemos derramado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich sehe doppelt von all dem Blut das wir vergossen haben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Visão dupla por todo o sangue que derramamos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В глазах двоится от крови что мы пролили</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Vedo doppio per tutto il sangue che abbiamo versato</span></p>
      <p begin="01:54.430" end="01:56.760" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="01:54.430" end="01:54.530">The</span> <span begin="01:54.530" end="01:55.160">on</span><span begin="01:55.160" end="01:55.320">ly</span> <span begin="01:55.320" end="01:55.520">way</span> <span begin="01:55.520" end="01:55.700">I'm</span> <span begin="01:55.700" end="01:55.910">lea</span><span begin="01:55.910" end="01:56.040">ving</span> <span begin="01:56.040" end="01:56.290">i</span><span begin="01:56.290" end="01:56.430">s</span> <span begin="01:56.430" end="01:56.760">dead</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若要我退场 唯有以死相逼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">若要我退場 唯有以死相逼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">俺がここを去るのは 屍となる時だけだ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내가 여기서 떠나는 건 죽었을 때뿐이야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je ne partirai d’ici que mort</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Solo me iré de aquí muerto</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich gehe hier nur tot von dannen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Só vou sair daqui morto</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я уйду отсюда только мёртвым</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Me ne andrò soltanto da morto</span></p>
      <p begin="01:56.820" end="02:00.120" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="01:56.820" end="01:56.970">Tha</span><span begin="01:56.970" end="01:57.070">t's</span> <span begin="01:57.070" end="01:57.120">the</span> <span begin="01:57.120" end="01:57.220">s</span><span begin="01:57.220" end="01:57.420">ta</span><span begin="01:57.420" end="01:57.550">te of</span> <span begin="01:57.550" end="01:57.800">my,</span> <span begin="01:57.800" end="01:57.930">s</span><span begin="01:57.930" end="01:58.170">ta</span><span begin="01:58.170" end="01:58.300">te of</span> <span begin="01:58.300" end="01:58.520">my,</span> <span begin="01:58.520" end="01:58.700">s</span><span begin="01:58.700" end="01:58.920">ta</span><span begin="01:58.920" end="01:59.070">te of</span> <span begin="01:59.070" end="01:59.440">my</span> <span begin="01:59.440" end="02:00.040">hea</span><span begin="02:00.040" end="02:00.120">d</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这便是我的 我的 我的心境</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">這便是我的 我的 我的心境</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">これが俺の 俺の 俺の心の有り様だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이게 바로 내 머릿속 내 상태 내 상태 내 상태야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Voilà l’état de mon esprit de mon esprit de mon esprit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Así está mi así está mi así está mi cabeza</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">So sieht es aus in meinem Kopf in meinem Kopf in meinem Kopf</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Esse é o estado da minha cabeça da minha cabeça da minha cabeça</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Вот что творится у меня в голове в голове в голове</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Questo è lo stato della mia testa della mia testa della mia testa</span></p>
      <p begin="02:00.570" end="02:01.740" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35"><span begin="02:00.570" end="02:00.810">They</span> <span begin="02:00.810" end="02:01.180">don't</span> <span begin="02:01.180" end="02:01.740">know</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们从不知道</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">他們從不知道</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">奴らは知らない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그들은 몰라</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ils ne savent pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ellos no saben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Sie wissen nicht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eles não sabem</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Они не знают</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Loro non sanno</span></p>
      <p begin="02:02.070" end="02:03.320" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36"><span begin="02:02.070" end="02:02.310">Where</span> <span begin="02:02.310" end="02:02.570">we've</span> <span begin="02:02.700" end="02:03.320">been</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们曾走过何等征途</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們曾走過何等征途</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">俺たちが何を越えてきたのか</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리가 어디를 거쳐 왔는지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Par où nous sommes passés</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Por dónde hemos pasado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wo wir gewesen sind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Por onde passamos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Через что мы прошли</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Dove siamo stati</span></p>
      <p begin="02:03.560" end="02:06.310" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37"><span begin="02:03.560" end="02:03.770">We</span> <span begin="02:03.770" end="02:04.000">got</span> <span begin="02:04.120" end="02:04.360">that</span> <span begin="02:04.470" end="02:04.710">con</span><span begin="02:04.840" end="02:05.110">crete</span> <span begin="02:05.110" end="02:05.240">s</span><span begin="02:05.240" end="02:05.490">treet</span> <span begin="02:05.490" end="02:05.640">s</span><span begin="02:05.640" end="02:06.310">kin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">街巷与水泥 早已磨成我们坚硬的皮囊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">街巷與水泥 早已磨成我們堅硬的皮囊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">この身には街路で刻まれた鋼の皮膚がある</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우린 콘크리트 거리에서 단련된 피부를 가졌어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">On a la peau dure forgée dans le béton des rues</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tenemos la piel curtida por calles de concreto</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wir haben eine Haut aus Beton und Asphalt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Temos a pele endurecida pelas ruas de concreto</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">У нас кожа закалённая бетонными улицами</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Abbiamo la pelle dura delle strade di cemento</span></p>
