      <p begin="02:33.910" end="02:36.060" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47"><span begin="02:33.910" end="02:34.320">I</span><span begin="02:34.320" end="02:34.380">'m</span> <span begin="02:34.690" end="02:34.890">brea</span><span begin="02:34.890" end="02:35.070">king</span> <span begin="02:35.070" end="02:35.270">down</span> <span begin="02:35.270" end="02:35.380">your</span> <span begin="02:35.460" end="02:36.060">door</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我要亲手撞开你的门扉</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我要親手撞開你的門扉</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">その扉ごと叩き壊してやる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">난 네 문을 부수고 들어가</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je suis en train d’enfoncer ta porte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Estoy derribando tu puerta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich breche deine Tür ein</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Estou arrombando a sua porta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я вышибаю твою дверь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sto sfondando la tua porta</span></p>
      <p begin="02:36.580" end="02:38.740" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48"><span begin="02:36.580" end="02:37.070">I</span><span begin="02:37.070" end="02:37.170">'m</span> <span begin="02:37.170" end="02:37.250">not</span> <span begin="02:37.250" end="02:37.370">s</span><span begin="02:37.370" end="02:37.460">pea</span><span begin="02:37.550" end="02:37.710">king</span> <span begin="02:37.710" end="02:37.890">un</span><span begin="02:37.890" end="02:37.960">der</span> <span begin="02:38.080" end="02:38.320">my</span> <span begin="02:38.440" end="02:38.700">brea</span><span begin="02:38.700" end="02:38.740">th</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我绝非低声自语</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我絕非低聲自語</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">もう声を潜めるつもりはない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">난 숨죽여 말하지 않아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je ne parle pas à voix basse</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No estoy hablando entre dientes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich rede nicht leise vor mich hin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não estou falando baixinho</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я не собираюсь говорить вполголоса</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non sto parlando sottovoce</span></p>
      <p begin="02:38.790" end="02:41.730" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49"><span begin="02:38.790" end="02:38.920">'Cau</span><span begin="02:38.920" end="02:39.000">se</span> <span begin="02:39.000" end="02:39.170">the</span> <span begin="02:39.170" end="02:39.360">har</span><span begin="02:39.360" end="02:39.560">der</span> <span begin="02:39.560" end="02:39.800">you</span> <span begin="02:39.920" end="02:40.160">pu</span><span begin="02:40.160" end="02:40.310">sh,</span> <span begin="02:40.520" end="02:40.690">the</span> <span begin="02:40.690" end="02:40.890">rou</span><span begin="02:40.890" end="02:41.070">gher</span> <span begin="02:41.070" end="02:41.440">I</span> <span begin="02:41.440" end="02:41.730">get</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你逼得愈狠 我便愈发强悍</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">你逼得愈狠 我便愈發強悍</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">強く押さえつけるほど 俺はさらに獰猛になる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">날 더 밀어붙일수록 난 더 거칠어져</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Parce que plus tu me pousses plus je deviens coriace</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Porque cuanto más me empujas más duro me vuelvo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Denn je härter du mich drängst desto härter werde ich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Porque quanto mais você me pressiona mais brutal eu fico</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Чем сильнее ты давишь тем жёстче становлюсь я</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perché più mi spingi più divento duro</span></p>
      <p begin="02:42.040" end="02:43.300" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50"><span begin="02:42.040" end="02:42.130">'Cau</span><span begin="02:42.130" end="02:42.200">se</span> <span begin="02:42.200" end="02:42.570">I'm</span> <span begin="02:42.570" end="02:42.790">not</span> <span begin="02:42.900" end="02:43.140">sha</span><span begin="02:43.140" end="02:43.300">king</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我绝不会动摇</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">因為我絕不會動搖</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">俺は揺るがない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">난 흔들리지 않아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Parce que je ne tremble pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Porque no tiemblo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Denn ich zittere nicht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Porque eu não tremo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Потому что я не дрогну</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perché non tremo</span></p>
      <p begin="02:43.300" end="02:44.800" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51"><span begin="02:43.300" end="02:43.490">When</span> <span begin="02:43.490" end="02:43.670">the</span> <span begin="02:43.670" end="02:43.880">ear</span><span begin="02:43.880" end="02:43.950">th</span> <span begin="02:43.950" end="02:44.050">s</span><span begin="02:44.050" end="02:44.280">tar</span><span begin="02:44.280" end="02:44.410">ts</span> <span begin="02:44.410" end="02:44.620">qua</span><span begin="02:44.620" end="02:44.800">king</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纵使大地开始震颤</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">縱使大地開始震顫</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">たとえ大地が震え始めても</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">땅이 뒤흔들리기 시작해도</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Quand la terre commence à trembler</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cuando la tierra empieza a sacudirse</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn die Erde zu beben beginnt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quando a terra começa a estremecer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Даже когда земля начнёт трястись</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Quando la terra comincia a scuotersi</span></p>
