      <p begin="02:48.570" end="02:51.200" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53"><span begin="02:48.570" end="02:49.180">Oh,</span> <span begin="02:49.180" end="02:49.260">my</span> <span begin="02:49.260" end="02:49.470">eye</span><span begin="02:49.470" end="02:49.550">s</span> <span begin="02:49.550" end="02:49.670">are</span> <span begin="02:49.670" end="02:50.080">see</span><span begin="02:50.080" end="02:50.420">ing</span> <span begin="02:50.420" end="02:51.130">re</span><span begin="02:51.130" end="02:51.200">d</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哦 我眼中只余一片血红</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">哦 我眼中只餘一片血紅</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">ああ この目は怒りに赤く染まる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">오 내 눈앞이 온통 붉게 보여</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Oh je vois rouge</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Oh lo veo todo rojo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Oh vor meinen Augen ist alles rot</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ah meus olhos só enxergam vermelho</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Эй перед глазами всё красное</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Oh vedo tutto rosso</span></p>
